1459:BSP/MPU6050/eMPL/inv_mpu.c **** /**
1460:BSP/MPU6050/eMPL/inv_mpu.c ****  *  @brief      Get gyro sensitivity scale factor.
1461:BSP/MPU6050/eMPL/inv_mpu.c ****  *  @param[out] sens    Conversion from hardware units to dps.
