1670:BSP/MPU6050/eMPL/inv_mpu.c **** /**
1671:BSP/MPU6050/eMPL/inv_mpu.c ****  *  @brief      Read the MPU interrupt status registers.
1672:BSP/MPU6050/eMPL/inv_mpu.c ****  *  @param[out] status  Mask of interrupt bits.
